  "description": "Mount a browsable, downloadable view of a directory on a route of an existing ASP.NET Core application: AddFileServer(), then MapFileServer(\"/docs\", o => o.RootPath = \"/srv/docs\"). Renders directory listings and Markdown with self-contained styles, resolves symlinks before every containment check, and serves files from endpoints rather than static-file middleware so RequireAuthorization() covers downloads as well as listings. Any number of independently configured and independently protected mounts per application.",
